WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 3444df0fcca33c086487f13e47f69d4f

00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:02.899
Habari, karibu kwenye uchambuzi wako wa kina wa kwanza. Basi,

00:00:02.939 --> 00:00:04.839
video hizi ni tofauti kidogo na

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.159
video za kufundishia ulizoziona hadi sasa. Ni ndefu zaidi,

00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:11.440
na hazina mpangilio mwingi. Nikishamaliza

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.100
hapa, itakuwa mimi tu

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.939
kwenye kompyuta mpakato nikizungumza nawe, nikieleza

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.680
mawazo fulani kwa kina zaidi, huenda nikitoka

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.280
nje ya mada mara kadhaa, labda nikizungumza kwa urefu kidogo,

00:00:21.319 --> 00:00:23.479
lakini natumaini nikikupa ufahamu zaidi

00:00:23.559 --> 00:00:27.600
wa jinsi ninavyofikiri kuhusu msimbo. Sasa, kutazama

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.419
video hizi za uchambuzi wa kina ni hiari kabisa. Unaweza

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.519
kuruka sehemu zake. Unaweza kurudi nyuma

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.479
ili kutazama mambo tena. Unaweza kuzipuuza

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:37.799
kabisa, hata usizibofye.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:40.059
Lakini tulipoendesha kozi hii kama

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:42.939
kambi ya mafunzo, watu waliniambia kwamba video hizi

00:00:42.979 --> 00:00:45.200
huenda ndizo zilikuwa sehemu yenye thamani zaidi ya

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.099
kozi nzima, kwa sababu ziliwapa ufahamu

00:00:47.139 --> 00:00:49.139
wa jinsi ninavyofikiri. Na kama nilivyosema

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.339
hapo awali, sehemu kubwa ya kozi hii ni

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.759
kukufundisha kufikiri kama msanidi programu, kama

00:00:53.799 --> 00:00:56.419
mwandishi wa msimbo. Kwa hiyo jaribu baadhi ya

00:00:56.459 --> 00:00:58.319
video hizi zinapotokea, uone

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:00.740
unaonaje. Kwa sasa, hakikisha una

00:01:00.799 --> 00:01:02.720
kikombe kizuri cha chai au kahawa. Kaa

00:01:02.779 --> 00:01:04.360
kwa utulivu, na hebu tuanze.

00:01:05.004 --> 00:01:09.203
Sawa, kwa hiyo katika video hizi za uchambuzi wa kina, nitatatua zoezi tu jinsi

00:01:09.203 --> 00:01:11.243
ambavyo ningelitatua kama ningekuwa nikiliona kwa mara ya kwanza.

00:01:11.563 --> 00:01:15.083
Kwa makusudi, nimejaribu kutoangalia kila zoezi kwa muda mrefu.

00:01:15.524 --> 00:01:18.083
Kisha ninarudi na kulitatua papo hapo,

00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:19.884
ili nisiwe na suluhisho nililolikariri.

00:01:20.364 --> 00:01:23.483
Ninalikabili kama ninavyotumaini wewe ulivyolikabili.

00:01:23.964 --> 00:01:27.323
Lakini thamani ya hili si kuona msimbo ninaoandika, angalau,

00:01:27.483 --> 00:01:29.483
na hasa si kwa mazoezi haya ya mwanzo.

00:01:29.564 --> 00:01:32.913
Huenda nikaandika msimbo uleule kabisa uliouandika wewe.

00:01:33.633 --> 00:01:37.593
Lengo kuu, angalau mwanzoni, ni wewe kufikiri jinsi ya kukabili

00:01:37.593 --> 00:01:41.633
matatizo, na mimi kukueleza jinsi ninavyoyakabili matatizo hayo.

00:01:42.124 --> 00:01:46.633
Tunapoendelea mbele katika kozi, kutakuwa na njia nyingi tofauti za

00:01:46.633 --> 00:01:50.273
kukabili tatizo. Nyingine zina faida, nyingine zina hasara.

00:01:50.754 --> 00:01:54.993
Na tutatumia muda mwingi kuchunguza njia hizo tofauti za kufikiri.

00:01:55.983 --> 00:01:59.673
Na unaweza kuchukua mantiki hii, uwezo huu wa kutatua matatizo,

00:01:59.993 --> 00:02:02.154
katika maeneo yote tofauti ya kupanga programu.

00:02:02.394 --> 00:02:05.114
Tunapozungumzia kujenga vitu, majukwaa,

00:02:05.114 --> 00:02:09.194
kwa vipande hivi vyote tofauti tunavyoviunganisha, labda hata bila kutumia msimbo,

00:02:09.353 --> 00:02:12.153
labda tunatumia modeli kubwa za lugha kutuandikia sehemu ya msimbo,

00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:17.273
jinsi tunavyofikiri ndicho kitu kimoja kisichobadilika kinachotuletea matokeo mazuri.

00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:20.954
Kwa hiyo kama hutachukua kitu kingine chochote kutoka kozi hii nzima,

00:02:21.273 --> 00:02:24.873
kitu kimoja ninachotumaini utakichukua ni jinsi tunavyofikiri.

00:02:25.984 --> 00:02:27.424
Basi, ni zoezi rahisi,

00:02:28.543 --> 00:02:31.183
huenda halikuonekana rahisi, lakini, lakini ni rahisi kiasi.

00:02:31.344 --> 00:02:33.903
Na tunajaribu tu kuchora uso wa mbweha,

00:02:34.344 --> 00:02:37.743
na tuna pembetatu kadhaa za kuchora.

00:02:38.704 --> 00:02:41.623
Basi, naangalia maagizo.

00:02:41.623 --> 00:02:43.623
Yananiambia jinsi ya kuchora pembetatu.

00:02:43.623 --> 00:02:49.103
Hili ni jambo ninalolijua vizuri. Na yananiambia baadhi ya rangi tofauti.

00:02:49.103 --> 00:02:53.224
Kwa hiyo tuna "white", "brown", "orange" na "charcoal" tunazoweza kutumia.

00:02:53.224 --> 00:02:57.094
Na tuna mashavu mawili meupe, masikio mawili ya kahawia, nusu mbili za uso za rangi ya chungwa,

00:02:57.564 --> 00:03:00.603
na kisha pua moja, lakini imeundwa na pembetatu mbili.

00:03:03.004 --> 00:03:07.724
Na kisha nimeandika dokezo hapa kwamba, unaweza kutumia, unaweza kuweka kipanya juu,

00:03:07.804 --> 00:03:12.364
unapaswa kutumia hivi. Na pia, namba zote zinagawanyika kwa 5.

00:03:12.444 --> 00:03:15.163
Na kitu pekee tunachotumia hapa ni kitendakazi hiki cha triangle.

00:03:16.284 --> 00:03:18.923
Kwa hiyo kama ningechora hii, ningefanyaje?

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:22.203
Naam, ningeanza kwa kusema, sawa, nahitaji, pembetatu.

00:03:22.444 --> 00:03:25.203
Kwa hiyo nitaandika triangle, triangle kwa ajili ya kitendakazi cha triangle.

00:03:25.444 --> 00:03:29.763
Na nahitaji nukta tatu. Basi nukta ya kwanza juu hapa naona 10, 6.

00:03:29.844 --> 00:03:34.043
Kwa hiyo najua hiyo ni 10, 5. Kitu kimoja ninachopenda kufanya ni kuweka

00:03:34.043 --> 00:03:36.083
hizi karibu karibu bila nafasi.

00:03:36.643 --> 00:03:41.444
Ili nione kwa namna fulani kwamba ni jozi ya viwianishi, kisha niache nafasi kati ya

00:03:41.923 --> 00:03:46.564
jozi za viwianishi. Hilo linafaa vizuri katika kitendakazi hiki cha triangle.

00:03:46.803 --> 00:03:50.163
Lakini pia ni jambo lenye manufaa kufikiria jinsi nafasi tupu,

00:03:51.103 --> 00:03:55.444
na kwa nafasi tupu tunamaanisha nafasi, mistari mipya, tabo, vitu hivi vyote,

00:03:56.303 --> 00:04:01.184
jinsi zinavyofanya msimbo wako usomeke kwa urahisi zaidi kwako na kwa watu wengine pia.

00:04:02.143 --> 00:04:05.184
Basi, mtindo mzuri mdogo. Weka viwianishi viwili pamoja,

00:04:05.184 --> 00:04:08.543
kisha acha nafasi kidogo kati ya jozi ili kutenganisha viwianishi.

00:04:09.024 --> 00:04:11.583
Haijalishi ni kipi kati ya hivi viwili kitakuwa kiwianishi changu cha pili.

00:04:11.583 --> 00:04:14.383
Lakini nitashuka hapa kwa 10, 40.

00:04:15.184 --> 00:04:19.103
Na mwisho nina hii hapa ambayo ni 50, 40.

00:04:19.823 --> 00:04:21.784
Kitu kimoja cha kukuonyesha ambacho huenda hujakiona,

00:04:21.784 --> 00:04:26.143
kuna mshale unaotokea juu ya namba ambao unaweza kuutumia kuisogeza namba hii.

00:04:26.464 --> 00:04:29.603
Hii itakuwa na manufaa zaidi kidogo baadaye tunapoangalia

00:04:29.603 --> 00:04:33.363
rangi fulani na vitu kama hivyo, inaweza kuwa huduma ndogo

00:04:33.363 --> 00:04:34.043
yenye manufaa kabisa.

00:04:34.853 --> 00:04:37.643
Kwa hiyo hii ni pembetatu yetu ya sikio hili la kushoto.

00:04:38.524 --> 00:04:41.883
Tunaona kwamba sikio la kushoto linapaswa kuwa kahawia.

00:04:42.603 --> 00:04:46.323
Kwa hiyo tunaandika brown. Na hiyo inapaswa kunipa sikio la kushoto.

00:04:46.323 --> 00:04:48.124
Na mara moja nitalikagua.

00:04:48.124 --> 00:04:53.483
Kwa hiyo nitabonyeza "Endesha Msimbo". Naona pembetatu hii inaonekana sawa hivi.

00:04:54.073 --> 00:04:57.833
Na nikiondoa mstari huu, nikiugeuza kuwa maoni kwa kuweka mikwaju miwili,

00:04:57.994 --> 00:05:01.233
tunaweza kuona kweli kwamba pembetatu inatoweka.

00:05:01.233 --> 00:05:05.513
Kwa hiyo tunaona imefanya kazi vizuri. Tuna hii na tunaweza kuendelea.

00:05:05.913 --> 00:05:08.073
Basi, inayofuata ni sehemu ya kushoto ya uso.

00:05:09.194 --> 00:05:15.233
Uso ni, sehemu ya rangi ya chungwa. Kwa hiyo hatuna sehemu ya kivuli nyuma ya hii.

00:05:15.233 --> 00:05:17.113
Tuna upande wa kulia wa uso tu.

00:05:17.673 --> 00:05:19.833
Kwa hiyo hebu tufikirie hili. Tunahitaji triangle.

00:05:20.904 --> 00:05:23.943
Na nikiangalia picha, naona ina ulinganifu.

00:05:24.503 --> 00:05:26.743
Dhana hii ya ulinganifu tutaitumia katika

00:05:26.743 --> 00:05:28.423
mazoezi kadhaa yajayo.

00:05:28.663 --> 00:05:31.743
Lakini tunaona kwamba nukta ya katikati itakuwa ileile.

00:05:31.743 --> 00:05:36.103
Kwa hiyo itaanzia 50, 30 na itaishia chini hapa kwenye ileile,

00:05:36.103 --> 00:05:38.503
ambayo kwangu inaonekana kama 50, 95.

00:05:39.303 --> 00:05:42.904
Na kisha tunahitaji kujua itaenda wapi huku.

00:05:43.704 --> 00:05:49.543
Na tunaweza kuona hilo kwa kuweka kipanya juu ya nukta hii, ambayo ina X ya 90 na Y ya 40.

00:05:50.483 --> 00:05:55.123
Kwa hiyo itakuwa X fulani, kisha 40,

00:05:55.603 --> 00:05:57.764
na itakuwa ya rangi ya chungwa.

00:05:59.284 --> 00:06:02.003
Lakini alama hii moja ya kuuliza, tuweke nini hapa?

00:06:02.243 --> 00:06:06.404
Naam, naangalia na naona kwamba eneo hili la kuchora lina upana wa 100,

00:06:06.404 --> 00:06:07.923
kwa hiyo linafika huku nje hadi 100.

00:06:08.724 --> 00:06:12.483
Na, hii ni 90. Kwa hiyo kuna pengo la 10 hapa.

00:06:13.284 --> 00:06:16.884
Kwa hiyo najua tutakuwa na pengo lilelile la 10 upande huu pia.

00:06:17.603 --> 00:06:18.803
Na najua kwamba

00:06:19.923 --> 00:06:24.644
0 jumlisha 10 ni 10, kwa hiyo najua hii itakuwa 10.

00:06:25.284 --> 00:06:30.084
Nabonyeza "Endesha Msimbo", na napata pembetatu nzuri ya rangi ya chungwa.

00:06:31.284 --> 00:06:35.923
Kisha nachora shavu la kushoto. Kwa hiyo ninanakili na kubandika tu hapa.

00:06:36.313 --> 00:06:39.443
Hebu tuchukue pembetatu hii. Hebu tufute vitu hivi vyote.

00:06:39.913 --> 00:06:43.363
Tuna kitendakazi chetu cha triangle, kwa hiyo sihitaji kukiandika tena.

00:06:44.253 --> 00:06:47.693
Na shavu letu la kushoto litakuwa jeupe.

00:06:48.253 --> 00:06:52.813
Kwa hiyo naweza kupima hii. Hii ni 10, 40,

00:06:54.654 --> 00:06:57.293
na hii ni 5, 60.

00:06:58.094 --> 00:07:00.053
Nimesahau koma. Kwa hiyo hii ni kitu kingine.

00:07:00.053 --> 00:07:03.134
Kidokezo kidogo. Unaona jinsi hii si nyekundu.

00:07:03.214 --> 00:07:07.454
Hii ni kama rangi isiyo sahihi. Hiyo inaitwa syntax highlighting.

00:07:07.613 --> 00:07:12.534
Ni neno la kiufundi tunalotumia. Lakini rangi unazoziona ni rangi za syntax

00:07:12.534 --> 00:07:13.053
highlighting.

00:07:14.053 --> 00:07:18.693
Kwa hiyo hii kutokuwa nyekundu ni ishara nzuri kwako kwamba umekosea kitu.

00:07:18.933 --> 00:07:21.654
Kwa hiyo ukiwahi kuona kitu kinachoonekana kuwa na rangi isiyo sahihi,

00:07:21.733 --> 00:07:24.373
hiyo ni ishara kwamba huenda umesahau koma.

00:07:24.534 --> 00:07:27.894
Huenda. Tukienda hapa na hatujafunga alama hizi za nukuu, unaweza kuona kwamba

00:07:28.293 --> 00:07:33.014
bano hili linakuwa kijani, jambo linaloonyesha kwamba unakosa alama za nukuu.

00:07:33.413 --> 00:07:35.974
Kwa hiyo rangi hizi kwa kweli zinakuwa na manufaa sana kama

00:07:35.974 --> 00:07:39.574
njia ndogo za mkato akilini mwako za kugundua kwamba kuna kitu kibaya.

00:07:41.224 --> 00:07:43.144
Basi weka koma. Na hii inakuwa ya rangi ya chungwa.

00:07:43.224 --> 00:07:50.584
Kwa hiyo 10, 40, 5, 60. Na kisha tunarudi chini hapa, ambayo ni 50 na 95.

00:07:51.943 --> 00:07:56.743
Na tunaweza kuandika white. Na tunaongeza hii na hiyo ni nzuri.

00:07:59.224 --> 00:08:04.264
Sawa. Sikio la kulia. Sasa tumeingia kwenye eneo la ulinganifu halisi, kwa namna fulani.

00:08:04.663 --> 00:08:09.224
Kwa hiyo tunajua kwa sikio la kulia. Inasema, unaweza kujua hili bila kuweka kipanya juu?

00:08:10.584 --> 00:08:13.543
Basi, ndiyo, tunaweza kujua hili bila kuweka kipanya juu.

00:08:13.863 --> 00:08:18.464
Kama uliweka kipanya juu na kufanya hivyo, unaweza kufikiria njia nyingine ya kulifanya?

00:08:18.464 --> 00:08:21.943
Na unaweza kufikiria labda kutumia tulichofanya hapa sasa hivi, ambapo

00:08:22.743 --> 00:08:26.024
nilichora shavu la kushoto kwa kuangalia shavu la kulia.

00:08:26.024 --> 00:08:28.024
Tungetumiaje hilo? Wazo lilelile?

00:08:28.024 --> 00:08:30.904
Ukitaka kusimamisha video kidogo na kufikiria hilo, unaweza kufanya hivyo,

00:08:31.863 --> 00:08:38.024
la sivyo, nitakuambia. Basi, tunajua hapa kwamba sikio la kushoto linaanzia 10.

00:08:38.253 --> 00:08:40.014
Na tunaona tuna hii 10, 5.

00:08:40.894 --> 00:08:44.894
Na tunajua tulivyosema awali, 0 jumlisha 10 ni 10.

00:08:45.053 --> 00:08:47.613
Na tuligundua kwamba shavu hili linaishia 90

00:08:48.413 --> 00:08:52.014
kwa sababu lina pengo la 10 na pengo hilohilo liko hapa.

00:08:52.413 --> 00:08:54.894
Kwa hiyo tunajua sikio hili linapaswa kuwa 90

00:08:56.094 --> 00:09:00.974
na, tunajua kwamba linashuka moja kwa moja hadi 90 na tunajua kwamba,

00:09:01.443 --> 00:09:03.693
linaingia hadi katikati kabisa kwenye 50.

00:09:04.413 --> 00:09:07.454
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kugeuza hilo na tunapata

00:09:08.654 --> 00:09:12.053
pembetatu ileile. Kisha tunaweza kufanya sehemu ya kulia ya uso.

00:09:12.053 --> 00:09:16.733
Na tena tunaweza kufanya hili bila kuweka kipanya juu, tukibadilisha tu 10 hii kuwa 90 kwa sababu

00:09:16.733 --> 00:09:22.454
ina ulinganifu. Na kisha tunaweza kufanya shavu la kulia, na shavu la kulia tena,

00:09:22.454 --> 00:09:28.974
tunataka ulinganifu. Kwa hiyo hii inakuwa 90, hii inakuwa 95 na hii inabaki 50

00:09:29.543 --> 00:09:31.063
na hii inatupa shavu jeupe.

00:09:31.543 --> 00:09:33.224
Na kisha tunahitaji pua yetu,

00:09:34.344 --> 00:09:38.983
pua yetu ni charcoal, kwa hiyo tunaweza kuandika triangle.

00:09:39.944 --> 00:09:44.023
Na kwa namna fulani nimejiharibia hii kidogo kwa sababu

00:09:44.023 --> 00:09:45.983
nimechora juu yake. Lakini tunaweza.

00:09:45.983 --> 00:09:50.743
Kwa hiyo una njia mbili. Moja, unaweza tu kugeuza msimbo wako wote kuwa maoni.

00:09:51.224 --> 00:09:54.103
Kwa hiyo unaweza tu kuweka, maoni fulani

00:09:55.554 --> 00:09:56.033
kama hivi

00:09:56.914 --> 00:09:59.074
na hiyo itakuwezesha

00:10:00.834 --> 00:10:04.873
kugeuza hii kuwa maoni. Kwa hiyo ukiwahi kupata hili, huenda umekosea kuandika.

00:10:04.873 --> 00:10:08.794
Huna haja ya kuogopa. Bonyeza tu "Endesha Msimbo", geuza kilicho na kosa kuwa maoni,

00:10:08.794 --> 00:10:10.594
bonyeza "Endesha Msimbo" tena, na inarudi.

00:10:11.233 --> 00:10:15.633
Kwa hiyo hapa tunaona hii inapaswa kuwa 50 na 85.

00:10:17.153 --> 00:10:20.753
Kwa hiyo 50 na 85. Na kisha tunaweza kuzirudisha hizi.

00:10:21.974 --> 00:10:22.273
Na.

00:10:26.353 --> 00:10:29.474
Kwa namna fulani nimefuta neno triangle kwenye hii ya kwanza.

00:10:30.113 --> 00:10:30.753
Sawa,

00:10:34.273 --> 00:10:36.674
kwa hiyo hebu tupime hii. Kwa hiyo 40, 90.

00:10:37.873 --> 00:10:42.194
Na tunajua ina ulinganifu. Kwa hiyo mara moja tunajua inayofuata itakuwa

00:10:42.194 --> 00:10:48.214
60, 90. Na tunajua hii ni charcoal, neno ambalo huwa napata shida kuliandika kwa usahihi.

00:10:48.934 --> 00:10:53.893
Tuna sehemu ya juu ya pua na kisha tuna sehemu ya chini ya pua.

00:10:54.214 --> 00:11:00.054
Na hii ni, pembetatu yenye ulinganifu na pembetatu hii ya juu.

00:11:00.454 --> 00:11:04.533
Kwa hiyo hii itakuwa na umbo, sawa kabisa na hii,

00:11:04.934 --> 00:11:07.493
lakini wakati hii inatoka 85 hadi 90,

00:11:07.893 --> 00:11:13.074
tunajua kwamba hii inapaswa kutoka 90 hadi 95 kwa sababu tena,

00:11:13.233 --> 00:11:16.834
tunaweza kufikiria 90 kama mstari ule wa kati, 5 juu, 5 chini.

00:11:17.873 --> 00:11:20.594
Na tuna sehemu ya chini ya pua yetu na kila kitu kinafaulu.

00:11:21.153 --> 00:11:24.393
Na kisha ningeondoa hizi TODO.

00:11:24.393 --> 00:11:26.834
Hebu tujaribu kuweka msimbo wetu, safi na nadhifu.

00:11:27.794 --> 00:11:31.794
Na, jambo jingine, katika baadhi ya video hizi utaona kitu hiki hapa chini.

00:11:31.794 --> 00:11:34.753
Hii ni kwa sababu tu ninaendesha msimbo kwenye kompyuta yangu mwenyewe

00:11:35.074 --> 00:11:36.513
badala ya kwenye tovuti ya Jiki.

00:11:36.834 --> 00:11:39.474
Nimewasha vitu vya ziada vya kutafuta hitilafu.

00:11:39.554 --> 00:11:42.824
Kwa hiyo ukiona chochote kati ya hivyo hapo chini, unaweza kukipuuza tu.

00:11:44.584 --> 00:11:46.824
Sawa, kwa hiyo tuna msimbo mzuri na nadhifu.

00:11:46.824 --> 00:11:49.623
Tunaweza kuondoa hii. "Unaweza kujua hili bila kuweka kipanya juu pia?"

00:11:50.103 --> 00:11:52.863
Na sasa hii inaeleza msimbo wetu.

00:11:52.863 --> 00:11:54.903
Kwa hiyo hii inasema hili ni sikio la kushoto.

00:11:54.903 --> 00:11:57.544
Na pengine ningebadilisha hizi ziseme tu jina la kitu.

00:11:58.103 --> 00:11:59.783
Kwa sababu hatutaki kwa kweli ziwe maagizo,

00:11:59.783 --> 00:12:02.263
tunataka tu zieleze msimbo unafanya nini.

00:12:02.344 --> 00:12:04.584
Lakini unaweza kuchagua chochote kilicho wazi zaidi kwako.

00:12:05.064 --> 00:12:08.344
Lakini kuwa na maoni haya yanayoeleza tu vitu hivi ni nini, ni vizuri.

00:12:08.344 --> 00:12:10.424
Labda nitaiita hii tu pua.

00:12:10.974 --> 00:12:14.013
Na ningekuwa na mistari miwili kama hii, na hiyo inajieleza yenyewe,

00:12:15.133 --> 00:12:16.733
na naweza pia kupanga vitu kwa makundi.

00:12:16.733 --> 00:12:20.013
Naweza pia kusema, sawa, nataka masikio mawili yawe pamoja

00:12:20.334 --> 00:12:25.054
na niandike tu masikio, na nataka sehemu za uso ziwe pamoja.

00:12:25.643 --> 00:12:29.454
Na nataka mashavu yawe pamoja

00:12:30.334 --> 00:12:30.974
kama hivi.

00:12:32.733 --> 00:12:36.054
Na yote bado yanafanya kazi, lakini sasa ni nadhifu zaidi kidogo.

00:12:36.054 --> 00:12:38.253
Unaweza pia kuona ulinganifu vizuri zaidi kidogo.

00:12:38.893 --> 00:12:41.253
Kwa hiyo kila mara chukua dakika chache ukishatatua

00:12:41.253 --> 00:12:43.594
zoezi, ili tu ujaribu kujivunia kweli.

00:12:43.594 --> 00:12:47.594
Upange msimbo vizuri, uufanye nadhifu kabisa, na utaona jinsi

00:12:47.594 --> 00:12:49.834
ulivyo wazi zaidi ukiwa na mistari hii miwili kando kwa kando.

00:12:50.263 --> 00:12:53.513
Inafanya tu kila kitu kionekane safi zaidi kidogo.

00:12:53.513 --> 00:12:56.633
Jambo moja la mwisho kabla hatujamaliza liko hapa chini.

00:12:56.633 --> 00:12:59.513
Nitasogeza tu hiki pembeni hapa chini.

00:13:00.233 --> 00:13:03.914
Unaona upau huu? Huenda hujautumia upau huu bado,

00:13:03.993 --> 00:13:06.474
lakini huu ndio tunaouita kitelezi.

00:13:07.113 --> 00:13:09.033
Kitakuwa na manufaa makubwa sana kwako baadaye.

00:13:09.434 --> 00:13:13.633
Lakini kinachokuwezesha kufanya ni kupita kati ya kila mstari wa msimbo.

00:13:13.633 --> 00:13:13.993
Yaani,

00:13:15.103 --> 00:13:19.344
mmoja baada ya mwingine. Kwa hiyo badala ya kuona uso mzima tu, unaweza kweli

00:13:19.824 --> 00:13:22.304
kupita hatua kwa hatua na kuona kila mstari wa msimbo unafanya nini.

00:13:22.704 --> 00:13:25.623
Na unapoandika programu zenye mistari 200

00:13:25.623 --> 00:13:28.983
ya msimbo, au zinazoendesha msimbo uleule mara nyingi

00:13:28.983 --> 00:13:31.424
sana, na labda kuna kama mambo elfu moja,

00:13:31.824 --> 00:13:34.023
elfu kumi yanayotokea katika programu yako, na

00:13:34.023 --> 00:13:35.743
tutafika kwenye mazoezi hayo hivi karibuni,

00:13:36.224 --> 00:13:40.944
hiki kinakuwa na manufaa makubwa sana, sana kwako.

00:13:41.883 --> 00:13:46.363
Pia tuna paneli hii ndogo ya taarifa unayoweza kuwasha na kuzima, iliyo juu hapa.

00:13:46.444 --> 00:13:50.964
Na tena, tukiwa na msimbo mgumu zaidi,

00:13:50.964 --> 00:13:53.003
hii itakuwa na hatua nyingi na itakuwa ya kina

00:13:53.003 --> 00:13:54.844
zaidi sana na ngumu zaidi sana.

00:13:55.483 --> 00:13:58.523
Lakini kwa sasa unaweza kuona tu inakuambia kwamba Jiki

00:13:58.603 --> 00:14:02.084
alitumia kitendakazi cha triangle na parameter hizi tofauti.

00:14:02.084 --> 00:14:05.283
Unaweza pia kuweka kipanya juu ya vitu hivi, kama vile juu ya triangle.

00:14:05.283 --> 00:14:09.164
Na utaona hapa inaangazia neno hili hapa na inaangazia mstari mzima.

00:14:09.783 --> 00:14:13.064
Tena, hilo huenda lisionekane kuwa na manufaa sana bado, lakini baadaye,

00:14:13.064 --> 00:14:15.824
ukiwa na labda hatua 20 na unataka

00:14:15.824 --> 00:14:19.064
kujua hasa kinachotokea katika kila sehemu ya mstari huu wa msimbo,

00:14:19.224 --> 00:14:20.903
hii itakufaa sana.

00:14:21.863 --> 00:14:24.424
Basi, ndiyo, na unaweza pia kubonyeza kitufe hiki cha kucheza.

00:14:24.533 --> 00:14:26.743
Ili tu kucheza, kucheza kila kitu hadi mwisho.

00:14:27.294 --> 00:14:30.674
Na ukirudi kwenye mchezo wako wa Space Invaders ambao,

00:14:30.674 --> 00:14:34.464
ambao umeshaufanya awali, unaweza kujaribu hilo sasa na unaweza kurudi nyuma,

00:14:34.464 --> 00:14:37.383
kutumia kitelezi, unaweza kuwatazama Space Invaders wakipigwa risasi,

00:14:37.623 --> 00:14:39.983
au unaweza kuingia kwenye mzingile na kutumia kitelezi hicho,

00:14:39.983 --> 00:14:43.263
kusogea nyuma na mbele ili kumtazama mhusika wako akitatua mzingile.

00:14:43.263 --> 00:14:46.023
Na kisha unaweza kubonyeza kucheza tena ili kucheza uhuishaji wote hadi mwisho.

00:14:46.263 --> 00:14:51.503
Kwa hiyo, ni kifaa kidogo chenye manufaa sana. Kuna mambo magumu zaidi nyuma yake pia

00:14:51.503 --> 00:14:54.503
ambayo tutayarudia katika uchambuzi wa kina wa baadaye.

00:14:54.824 --> 00:14:56.664
Lakini kwa sasa, natumaini hii imekuwa na manufaa.

00:14:56.853 --> 00:15:02.103
Ninasubiri kwa hamu wakati tutakapozama kweli katika mazoezi magumu baadaye.

00:15:02.533 --> 00:15:06.373
Lakini nitakuacha uendelee. Natumaini utafurahia mazoezi yajayo ya kuchora.

00:15:06.773 --> 00:15:08.853
Endelea kujaribu kufikiri kuhusu jinsi unavyofikiri.

00:15:09.174 --> 00:15:13.814
Chukua muda wako, fanya msimbo wako uwe nadhifu, na, ndiyo, utafanya vizuri sana.

00:15:13.893 --> 00:15:14.773
Asante kwa kutazama.
